# None of the Dockerfiles COPY anything from the build context: they fetch the
# SPM release over the network instead. Without this file `docker build .`
# uploads the whole working tree to the daemon, which in CI includes the
# multi-gigabyte spm-tests-data checkout.
*

# Exception: a Dockerfile variant that wraps a locally built standalone (rather
# than a published release) needs the zip to reach the daemon.
!spm_standalone_*.zip
